Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dyoshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obadiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Full
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.89,0:00:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die tomorrow,\NI'm going to die.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Arukenimon set a trap for\Nus at Giga House in the Digital World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't believe how big it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a house of horrors!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody should refer a good exterminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if the bugs weren't enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.28,0:01:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukenimon's flute put Stingmon\Nand Digmon under her evil spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xvmon tried to stop them,\Nbut not before Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, and Ken got caught\Nin a giant spider web.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unfortunately for them,\Nit's Dokugumon's feeding time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx95\fscy95\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(321,311)}Archnemon - The Spider Woman's Mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to do this, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey lady, don't you know any other tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I don't surf the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate websites.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us! Help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry Davis, but I'm a\Nlittle tied up at the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize you're\Nfighting your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, can't we all just get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, we're bug meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Ken, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you. Come on,\Nguys! Knock it off! Keep trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Cody, you're our only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're useless, but your hands are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to contact the\Nothers and tell them to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't brain freeze on us. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yoli, be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're doing, it\Ncan't be as dangerous as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help, but I'm\Nsort of busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, it's time we\Nrise to the occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my hands are full!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try Kari and TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here in fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd kill for a can of bug spray right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to wish\Nwe had never split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm afraid they can't\Ncome either. We're on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a tunnel break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it anymore.\NDoesn't she know another song?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's available Then you help us Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.48,0:04:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do to help,\Nespecially without Digmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't think of something\Nfast, those guys are through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what do I\Nhave to work with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thermostat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means there must be\Nan air conditioner nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can blow Dokugumon off of the web.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:04:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like playing soccer, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bicycle kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,David shoots, he scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, great play!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you, Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not just\Npulling my leg, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is what I call a king-size bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, X-Beamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need your help. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:05:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, old buddy, you did\Na good job holding them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean I gotta hide\Nin somebody's underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bigger the shoe, the bigger the stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's close it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I sure hope it holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Digmon\Nis trying to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone please explain to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does that obnoxious flute\Nmake insect Digimon flip out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It creates a vibration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we stop the sound, then\NDigmon would help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think R .U.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kunemon is about to take\Npiano lessons instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys familiar with\Nthe story of the moth and the bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moth heard the sound the\Nbat made and used it to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a trick of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moth was able to create its own sound\Nand mixed it with the sound of the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bat became confused and lost its way,\Nenabling the moth to escape unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that was the story\Nof the birds and the bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is find a way\Nto alter the sound of the flute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then if our theory holds, the insect\NDigimon will return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how does the story of\Nthe birds and the bees go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need some more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could measure the length\Nof the flute's sound waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would help determine our move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have a solution, but there's\Nno real way of carrying it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, guys, I know\Nexactly what to do! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's true, that's my specialty,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how am I supposed to figure\Nit out without a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a computer right\Nhere in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm beginning to get a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your first left. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, left!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go in through the outdoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not leave your position\Nin case Yuki needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those must be very popular books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfecto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll put the brakes on that Motimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:08:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the music software program.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's not familiar with\Nit, it'll be difficult to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably going to be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive it's not gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli's a real professional when\Nit comes to stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My older sister's in the\Ndrama club at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm the one that does the\Nsound for all of the shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also helped Izzy do the mixing\Nfor Matt's band, The Teenage Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were the best because they sounded\Ntotally cool after we got through with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered why Matt's band\Nsounded so good lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt said it was because he\Nwas such a great musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to, like, tell him I know\Nhis secret weapon is Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any time to\Nwaste on idle chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I need for you to hook up the\Nmicrophone cable to the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shurimon, I'm counting on\Nyou to protect T .K.'s back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect the rest of them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, T .K., let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mass is too big for me to push alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could help me Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good you hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, beat it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you on my count?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's push!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't wait! Go for it,\NYoli! Gotcha! Let's go! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All plugged in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All plugged!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what we have to do\Nis record that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I just don't hear a single.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop recording, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take this section to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got all that? I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll delete the section\Nthat we don't need and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we'll save the part\Nthat's left as a sound file.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll copy and paste the\Noriginal onto multiple tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and use special effects to\Ndistort the sound bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is press play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I have no idea what\Nyou're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it'll work. Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play that funky music! Now, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name that tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Are they normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.34,0:12:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we doing in this drawer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playing hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is absolutely beyond belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you actually can't remember\Nanything about what was happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to psych you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's time to face the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady, this is what\NI think of your floob!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could she jump down all that way\Nwithout getting a single scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think she could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you finally caught on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Archnemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arookinimon, an ultimate Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my parlor, said\Nthe spider to the flymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so good to be back to my true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so cracked in that human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel pretty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you don't scare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then I've done a terrible job as host.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make up for it by terrifying you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digibum, Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong Crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.84,0:14:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what we need, a new enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's squash this one like a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat-I-V!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Equus-me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double-star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acid Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have the sudden urge to sit\Non a toughet eating curds and whey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to exterminate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just crawling deeper into my web.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sting strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put her right where\Nshe belonged. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:15:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spider Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take her down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's trap her in the dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need everybody's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, Ken, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to try to lead Aru\NKunemon into the dining room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to change a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow us, Parrotmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Are you ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprised ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a little salt bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every spider's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some eau de la bug spray, madame?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It needs some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get her, Pai Ultraman!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what did the\NDigidestined ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and why do you want to\Ndestroy the digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a ridiculous question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I want to destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I live for, you\Nmiserable excuse for a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you've changed several\NControl Spires into Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, that's another\Npreposterous question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even have any idea\Nwhat the Control Spires are for,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it would be a big waste of\Ntime to try to explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not talking. Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like she wants to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she gets away, she will just\Ncontinue to destroy the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the very least I could do for you\Nguys after all the damage that I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no I in team
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should find a place that\Nwe can put her that's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.72,0:18:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then make sure she's locked up\Ntight so she can't escape you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't any place around\Nthat's strong enough to hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two words anger management,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you're still looking\Nfor a fight then bring it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then... What will you take on?\NTwo Ultimates? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think of me as a\Nwell-wrapped present.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we could spend some\Nquality time together, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'll let you in on a\Nlittle secret I've had under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My snake bandage attack is ghostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's such a mummy's boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to make our getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to disturb them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good news is we're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad news is Archnemon has friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering what they really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have some reason\Nfor being so nasty and mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i think they feel destroying everything is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simply fun just the\Nthought of it makes me sick
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon like that must\Nbe really mixed up but
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can be healed just\Nlike people oh thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you helped me huh you saved my life and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though you were\Nthe mean digimon emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i still owe you one what are you talking\Nabout why you don't owe me anything at
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all cody your air conditioner idea was\Ngenius nope i'm sorry i still owe you ken and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i always repay my debts okay whatever you\Nwant come on Cody don't be like that and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,besides if anyone owes anything Davis\Nowes me put it on my tab but I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that Cody saved Ken just to repay a debt
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there must have been\Nsomething more deep and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,important that we'll never know about what\Ndo you think Chibimon you might be right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but personally I think that Cody's\Nembarrassed knowing him you're probably right
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like they tossed you around a bit\Ntoo much how are you doing don't even
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know where\Nyou can get a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as soon as we get back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to our hideout, I'm going to make\Nyou look almost as bad as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why didn't you destroy\Nthose kids when you rescued me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget to wrap your brain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in those bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.03,0:20:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was just trying to be romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There won't be anything\Nleft of me to romance if
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those kids keep tearing\Ndown the control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a main source of\Npower and without them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're finished will the\Ndigi-destine destroy all the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,control spires before our\NKunemon gets her evil hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on them find out next time\Non digimon digital monsters
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can connect together with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you give up your power?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't go anywhere, anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when they're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody is in the corner.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.22,0:22:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.36,0:22:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone.
